00:08:40,760 --> 00:08:42,440
 but also technically complex.

224
00:08:42,440 --> 00:08:44,800
 Like I guess it's great that we're paying Stripe

225
00:08:44,800 --> 00:08:46,480
 to handle this complexity today.

226
00:08:46,480 --> 00:08:48,160
 But obviously we should be in a world

