00:09:00,600 --> 00:09:01,680
 and they don't have to deal with the offering

233
00:09:01,680 --> 00:09:04,240
 in the first place, but you don't want to be in a world

234
00:09:04,240 --> 00:09:07,280
 where you're beholden to a couple of large players

235
00:09:07,280 --> 00:09:10,040
 to make the global payment system look coherent,

236
00:09:10,040 --> 00:09:12,440
 even though it fundamentally isn't coherent.

237
00:09:12,440 --> 00:09:13,880
 And that's what we're at now.

238
00:09:13,880 --> 00:09:15,000
 - Let's talk about that.

239
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:16,520
 We've got a global financial system.

240
00:09:16,520 --> 00:09:18,680
 It's not as though you can't move money.

241
00:09:18,680 --> 00:09:20,960
 What's wrong with what we have right now?

242
00:09:20,960 --> 00:09:24,200
 - I think people would really underestimate just how broken

243
00:09:24,200 --> 00:09:26,520
 the system is, but also specifically how many people

244
00:09:26,520 --> 00:09:29,040
 are in the loop on simple payment transactions

245
00:09:29,040 --> 00:09:30,280
 that we all take for granted.

246
00:09:30,280 --> 00:09:34,300
 So we did a big study on people paying

247
00:09:34,300 --> 00:09:36,120
 from Vietnam to Mexico.

248
00:09:36,120 --> 00:09:37,760
 There's a bunch of intermediaries in there

249
00:09:37,760 --> 00:09:39,080
 looking at pieces of paper

250
00:09:39,080 --> 00:09:40,760
 and they're deciding a payment can go through.

251
00:09:40,760 --> 00:09:42,960
 And each of those do use a correspondent bank.

252
00:09:42,960 --> 00:09:43,880
 They might take $20.

253
00:09:43,880 --> 00:09:46,000
 They can't even estimate that amount of money in advance.

254
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:47,720
 Like that's how broken the system is,

255
00:09:47,720 --> 00:09:49,440
 that when you go to make that transaction,

256
00:09:49,440 --> 00:09:51,160
 you don't even really know what the person

257
00:09:51,160 --> 00:09:52,960
 that aside will necessarily get.

258
00:09:52,960 --> 00:09:55,240
 So FX fees that are getting taken,

259
00:09:55,240 --> 00:09:56,360
 they're correspondent bank things.

260
00:09:56,360 --> 00:09:58,400
 You send a thousand bucks, you might be paying a hundred.

261
00:09:58,400 --> 00:10:00,440
 I mean, the numbers are, they differ quite a bit.

